				<h3 class="m-0">Text Display Mesher</h3>
				<p class="m-0">
					A tool for rendering <code>obj</code> and <code>glTF</code> 3D models in Vanilla Minecraft using text displays.
				</p>
			</div>
		</helion-card>

		<helion-card>
			<img class="w-full" width="1200" height="630" src="/misc/ascii3d/demos/water/thumbnail.webp" alt="Ascii 3D" />
			<div class="p-3">
				<h3 class="m-0">Ascii 3D</h3>
				<p class="m-0">
					A 3D rendering pipeline that outputs ASCII characters instead of pixels. This was featured on <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ARQh52GHNtk&t=1710s" target="_blank">BxJS Weekly</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</helion-card>

		<!--<helion-card>
			<img class="w-full" width="1200" height="630" src="/tools/reuleaux-polygon-generator/thumbnail.webp" alt="Reuleaux Polygon Generator" />
			<div class="p-3">
